  "period_note": "Balance sheet is the 31-Mar-2021 period-end snapshot (reported), Solo basis. Income statement items are CUMULATIVE from 1 January 2021 (Q1=3 months). OCR'd (pdftoppm 300dpi + tesseract) - the raw pdftotext extraction of this filing has severe scattered digit corruption (e.g. missing leading digits, '1' rendered as 'l'); the OCR pass used here is materially cleaner. Comparative (31-Dec-2020) column matches this dataset's existing 2020_Q4.json exactly for total_assets (303,516.861297m), total_equity (16,946.727385m), paid_up_capital (8,853.46404m), statutory_reserve (6,430.798085m), total_deposits (229,484.573179m) and off_balance_sheet_exposures (63,852.699814m). Balance-sheet identity holds (280,748.68932 + 17,666.046418 = 298,414.73574, matches 298,414.735737 reported to rounding). statutory_reserve corroborated by the bank's 20%-of-PBT rule: prior year-end (6,430.798085m) + 20% of this quarter's profit-before-tax (1,097.79474m x 20% = 219.558948m) = 6,650.357033m, matching exactly. total_deposits total (221,000.151474m) is the reported subtotal; the 'Fixed Deposit/Mudaraba fixed deposits' component itself was not separately legible (implied ~164,761.49m by subtraction). Income statement fully reconciles: operating_profit = total_operating_income - total_operating_expenses (2,243.79655-1,236.00249=1,007.79406 exact); profit_before_tax = operating_profit - total_provision (1,007.79406 - (-90.00068) = 1,097.79474 exact, i.e. total_provision was a net RELEASE/reversal of 90.00068m this quarter); profit_after_tax = profit_before_tax - tax_expense (1,097.79474-378.361553=719.433187 exact).",
